# Project context

This is a bare, self-contained `.lmml` narrative -- plain text, openable
and editable anywhere, with no external files to lose track of. It is
also perfectly valid Markdown, so any generic Markdown viewer renders it
sensibly even without knowing about `lmml` at all.

The project's settings are carried directly in the narrative, as an
inline embed:

@@@settings.yaml
model: gpt-5
temperature: 0.2
tools:
  - read_files
  - run_shell_command
@@@

Since the embed's content lives right here in the text (rather than
being a `@name.ext` reference into a `.lmmlz` archive), this file needs
nothing else to be fully self-contained. See
`Lmml.Bundle.new_text/2`/`Lmml.Bundle.open/1` to load a narrative like
this one, and `Lmml.Manifest.load/1` if it also carried an optional
`manifest.json` embed.
